        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_33f01dd9e90342eb9c10fc1215a0b206",
      "statement": "An auto-approved friend_request resolves the capped role spec and calls directory.approve with exactly spec permissions and rate limits, and the reply friend_accept carries granted (the actual matrix just installed, e.g. client has task:submit but no file:write) plus granted_role, so the requester is told precisely what it received — the transparent counter-offer rather than ambiguous silence.",
